From 9b488f1cdcdc31a97662428e950adff58b19a002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 31 Mar 2026 22:29:13 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] [feature] LineageParts: Add Dynamic Bar settings

[byben] Adapt from crDroidSettings for LineageOS 24.0:
- host the toggle under Settings > System > Status bar
- use lineageos.preference / androidx.preference classes available in tree
- back the battery chip mode list with Settings.Secure instead of LineageSettings
- drop crDroid guide/demo views and icon resources not present in tree

Co-authored-by: ShevT <evgeny.shishkov@gmail.com>

Change-Id: If708c47cfc9a4979b355f7d8cdd6d638
---
 res/values/arrays.xml                         |  12 ++
 res/values/strings.xml                        |  66 ++++++
 res/xml/dynamic_bar_settings.xml              | 174 +++++++++++++++
 res/xml/status_bar_settings.xml               |   6 +
 .../statusbar/DynamicBarSettings.java         | 203 ++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 461 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 res/xml/dynamic_bar_settings.xml
 create mode 100644 src/org/lineageos/lineageparts/statusbar/DynamicBarSettings.java

